      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5bbbf6aa17bab877dd8bc723|full_name}: In some MMOs games, there is name tag scaling. So if the player is bit far, the name is still readable and then faded out. When the player is very near you, the name is not bigger than on far distance, but stays small and readable.\n\nThe problem in VRChat is the fixed size of nametags. At far distance, they are very small and useless. When they come near, the nametag is so big and it can cover my face cam especially i am big and others are small. I am forced to turn tags off because it blocked too much.\n\nMake it just small is good idea, but might problem if it's still busy in the room. Fade out at very near distance is better option. If you want read tag again, just take some distance and  it will visible again.\n\nThere is already option in menu where players very near you will vanished. This option can seperated for name tags only, so they vanish when player is very near you. Use this function!",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
